\subsection{Cross-KIC Variation}

While all KICs exhibit constellations with similar configurations, their relative emphases differ.

Notable patterns:

\begin{itemize}
    \item \textbf{Acceleration emphasis}: EIT Digital and EIT InnoEnergy show the strongest Acceleration configuration, consistent with their sectors' venture ecosystems and historical focus on startup creation.
    \item \textbf{Development emphasis}: EIT Health exhibits elevated Development configuration, reflecting the healthcare sector's credentialing requirements and EIT Health's extensive Master's programme portfolio.
    \item \textbf{Accountability emphasis}: EIT Climate-KIC and EIT Food show stronger Accountability configurations, reflecting their engagement with policy-intensive domains (climate action, food security).
    \item \textbf{Maturity effects}: Older KICs (Climate-KIC, Digital, InnoEnergy---established 2010) show somewhat higher interconnectedness than newer KICs, suggesting that constellation integration develops over time.
\end{itemize}


